<view class="login-head">
  <view class="logo">🛒</view>
  <view class="name">{{ siteName }}</view>
  <view class="muted">登录后即可下单、查看订单与卡密</view>
</view>

<view class="wrap">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="field" style="margin-top:0">
      <view class="label">账号</view>
      <input class="input" placeholder="请输入账号" value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">密码</view>
      <input class="input" password placeholder="请输入密码" value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="btn block" style="margin-top:40rpx" bindtap="submit">{{ loading ? '登录中…' : '登录' }}</view>

    <block wx:if="{{ wechatEnabled }}">
      <view class="divider">或</view>
      <view class="btn block wechat" bindtap="onWechatLogin">微信一键登录</view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="tip muted" wx:if="{{ !releaseEnable }}">
    <text class="warn">小程序暂未上架：</text>当前仅用于内部调试，正式开放请等待运营通知。
  </view>
  <view class="tip muted" wx:else>
    支付默认走账户余额；微信支付与微信授权登录由后台开关控制，未开启时不影响账号密码登录。
  </view>

  <view class="links" wx:if="{{ agreementUrl || privacyUrl }}">
    <text wx:if="{{ agreementUrl }}" data-url="{{ agreementUrl }}" bindtap="copyLink">《用户协议》</text>
    <text wx:if="{{ privacyUrl }}" data-url="{{ privacyUrl }}" bindtap="copyLink">《隐私政策》</text>
  </view>
</view>
